# T18 — Automation trigger engine: DONE

## Files owned and changed
- `test/automations.test.ts` (new): fail-first test covering all five
  trigger kinds — schedule (cron floor + coalescing), GitHub
  (repo/branch/author/labels), Slack (channel/author/text), webhook
  (secret-once + path dispatch), manual (enabled/disabled gating).
- `src/automations.ts` (new): pure, dependency-free trigger engine.
  `Automation` = `{id, prompt, triggers[], repoUrl, enabled, runAs,
  webhookSecret?, lastTriggeredAt?, runCount}`. Exports `validateCron`
  (five-field, 5-min floor on the minute field), `isScheduleDue`
  (missed ticks coalesce into one run, never a backlog),
  `matchGitHubTrigger` / `matchSlackTrigger`, `verifyWebhookSecret`
  (constant-time), `createAutomation` (webhook secret returned ONCE),
  `matchAutomationEvent` (triggers OR'd, at most one run per event,
  disabled never fires), `recordTrigger`, `parseAutomationWebhookPath`
  (`/api/automations/{id}/trigger`), `AutomationStore` (in-memory backing
  for the future `Automations` DO), `collectDueSchedules` (the
  `scheduled()` fan-out; caller `recordTrigger`s each hit).
- `wrangler.jsonc`: added `"triggers": { "crons": ["*/5 * * * *"] }` —
  the 5-minute floor tick driving the scheduled() fan-out.
- Untouched as required: package.json, Dockerfile.

## TDD evidence
- BEFORE implement: `npx vitest run test/automations.test.ts` → FAIL
  (Cannot find module '../src/automations.js').
- AFTER implement: `npx vitest run test/automations.test.ts` → PASS (11 passed).
- `npx eslint src/automations.ts test/automations.test.ts` → clean.
- `npm run typecheck` → no errors in T18 files. (Pre-existing errors in
  `test/runtime.test.ts` belong to concurrent in-flight sessions; untouched.)

## Full suite (for the record, not gated by T18)
- `npx vitest run` → 154 passed / 8 failed. All 8 failures are
  out-of-scope in-flight work: `test/runs.test.ts` (T2 raised
  MAX_CONCURRENT_RUNS 3→5, test still expects 3), `test/runtime.test.ts`
  + `test/orchestrator-result.test.ts` (concurrent sessions' uncommitted
  edits). `test/automations.test.ts` is 11/11 green.

